{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-common-biology-13","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":13,"points":null,"unitId":"development","unitLabel":"발생·분화","topic":"발생·배아·체절","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["development","ecology","immune"],"stem":"곤충에서패턴형성인자의조절기작을알아보기위하여초기\n배아를가는실로묶은후, 그발생양상을관찰하였다.\n위실험결과에대한해석이나추론으로옳은것을<보기>에서\n모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 앞쪽패턴형성인자는묶은부위의앞쪽에존재할것이다.\nㄴ. 묶음에의해주로가운데체절이결실되는것으로보아\n이부위의패턴형성은앞․뒤패턴형성인자사이의\n상호작용에의해이루어질것이다.\nㄷ. (라)처럼세포질을묶은부위바로앞․뒤로동시에이식\n하면앞쪽에는정상적인배아가, 뒤쪽에는앞․뒤가\n역전된부분배아가생길수있다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":742,"height":703,"region":0,"bbox":[14.15,45.204,296.8,281.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-13/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":744,"height":361,"region":0,"bbox":[14.15,383.604,297.6,144.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-13/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":4,"sourceRect":[37.45,66.396,360.0,643.661],"width":322.55,"height":577.265,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.15,45.204,296.8,281.2],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.15,383.604,297.6,144.4],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"13. 곤충에서패턴형성인자의조절기작을알아보기위하여초기","bbox":[5.0,5.0,307.388,11.032],"spans":[{"text":"13.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,12.99,11.032],"origin":[5.0,13.826]